WEBVTT

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:07.580
Thank you.

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:22.480
The Quick-Play Magic, Devoted Love.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:26.760
"At the end of a battle, your opponent draws one card."

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:30.590
"At the end of your turn, your Life Points hit zero."

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:32.380
What's <i>with</i> this card?

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:35.610
It's useless if it makes your own Life hit zero!

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:36.300
Anna-<i>chan</i>!

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:38.430
Big sis Umimi!

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:44.230
You may not understand right now, but you'll get the meaning of that card some day.

00:00:57.580 --> 00:00:58.950
Welcome!

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:00.320
Won't you join us?

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:06.450
Good afternoon!

00:01:06.450 --> 00:01:08.640
Welcome to Monster Cafe!

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:12.510
The menu is over here.

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:15.900
Please draw your menu items.

00:01:17.290 --> 00:01:18.690
Then... this one!

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:21.240
Certainly!

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:22.190
One Hungry Burger-

00:01:25.730 --> 00:01:27.560
Yo, Kotori!

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:30.300
I heard you were having a school festival,
 so I came to hang out!

00:01:30.630 --> 00:01:32.780
A-Anna?!

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:36.750
What's the big deal here?!

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:37.990
This is overkill!

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:38.670
Anna?!

00:01:39.880 --> 00:01:41.950
What the heck are you doing?!

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:43.230
Yuma!

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:44.350
Yuma?

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:47.560
What the heck's with that outfit?

00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:49.710
I'm Tenten Tempo the Percussion Djinn.

00:01:49.730 --> 00:01:52.230
That's a perfect match for you!

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:55.070
It couldn't be helped! I lost at rock, paper, scissors!

00:01:56.820 --> 00:01:59.430
But <i>I</i> think he looks really <i>cute</i>!

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:03.960
I <i>love</i> Yuma the way he is now!

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:10.090
Yuma, I actually think it looks just like you.

00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:11.270
Quiet, you.

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:13.980
Big news! Big news!

00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:16.900
Yuma-<i>kun</i>, I've got big news!

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:19.150
Couple Duel Tournament?

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:22.740
Yes! It's being organized by the school committee,

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:26.930
and the two Habara Pro Duelists -- Tobio and Umimi -- are going to be there as guests!

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:30.830
They say Tobio and Umimi

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:33.870
are an unmatched Tag Duel pair that will show off their skills!

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:35.650
We can't ignore that!

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:37.100
You serious?!

00:02:38.660 --> 00:02:42.140
Dueling against Pro Duelists in a tag match?! I'm fired up!

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:47.570
I hear that the couple entering the tournament will be brought closer together!

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:53.520
The rumor is that Contestant Umimi is quitting Dueling and this is a sort of service to her fans.

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:55.980
What do you mean she's quitting Dueling?!

00:02:57.380 --> 00:02:58.860
Why would she?!

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:00.110
Hey, Anna!

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:03.520
E-Even if you ask me...

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:04.660
Shit!

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:10.260
<i>No way... Why would Big Sis Umimi stop Dueling?</i>

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:16.120
Yuma, enter the Couple Duel Tournament with me!

00:03:16.510 --> 00:03:17.950
Huh? With me?

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:22.430
Just hold on a minute! Why would Yuma enter a Coupe Duel Tournament with <i>you</i>?

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:24.910
Why? Well...

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:28.640
Anyway, I have to enter this!

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:30.570
Wh-What's your deal?!

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:32.280
Yeah, that's a big no!

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:34.060
Yuma's entering with <i>this</i> cat!

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:36.070
Wh-Why'd it come to <i>that</i>?!

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:38.730
Anyway, I'm going to be a couple with Yuma!

00:03:38.970 --> 00:03:39.860
He can't do that!

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:41.200
Then with me!

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:42.350
He can't do that <i>either</i>!

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:43.150
Why?!

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:45.780
Sorry to do this while you're in the middle of this...

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:48.730
Kotori and Cat-<i>chan</i> is one thing,

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:52.750
but I don't think you can enter the Couple Duel Tournament.

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:54.420
Wh-Why?!

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:58.780
Because only students from our school can attend!

00:03:59.770 --> 00:04:01.170
Y-You're kidding!

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:07.370
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:13.340
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:04:13.340 --> 00:04:16.050
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:04:25.850 --> 00:04:28.400
<i>Preparations for the fight are ready</i>

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:31.480
<i>I can already hear the shivering of my heart</i>

00:04:31.650 --> 00:04:35.990
<i>Been waiting this whole time</i>

00:04:35.990 --> 00:04:38.360
<i>I may meet with defeat...</i>

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:41.580
<i>But that's exactly why I have to stand back up</i>

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:46.120
<i>Need to get stronger again</i>

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:48.250
<i>It's good to believe</i>

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:50.960
<i>The "now", more than ever before, is</i>

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:53.420
<i>but another limit to break down</i>

00:04:53.420 --> 00:04:56.470
<i>I can cross with ease</i>

00:04:56.760 --> 00:04:58.930
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:04:58.930 --> 00:05:04.970
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:07.730
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:09.190
<i>Right here in my hand,</i>

00:05:09.190 --> 00:05:13.900
<i>I'm holding a powerful trump card.</i>

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:22.950
<i>With an unbreakable heart, I face toward my dream!</i>

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:38.100
Ah, my dear prince!

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:41.270
I've yearned to tell you this for what seems like eternity!

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:45.440
"A Fierce Couple Duel:
 "That Anna Chick" and I are a Tag Team!?"

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:44.240
During days of chilling rain...

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:46.070
During days of freezing snow!

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:49.820
Oh, my  dear princess!

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:53.830
What a disgusting play. I can't watch a second more!

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:56.370
Now, now, just calm down, Big Brother!

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:56.910
Hmm?

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:59.750
The hell is <i>with</i> you?

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:01.250
I'm the Gogogogo Golem.

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:03.420
Big Brother.

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:05.800
<i>B-big brother</i>, you said?!

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:07.720
You have <i>no right</i> calling me that!

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:09.050
Shut up!

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:13.890
If you aren't gonna watch in silence, get the hell out!

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:17.850
"Welcome! Flower Arrangement Club"

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:25.480
It feels a bit too stiff.

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:27.400
Is that so?

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:28.200
However...

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:32.070
Flowers are the reflection of one's heart.

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:33.580
You are too serious.

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:36.040
But I don't dislike that.

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:38.920
Y-Y-Yes~!

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:46.880
I did it!

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:50.010
I got tickets to see Sanagi Chouno-<i>chan</i> <i>live</i>!

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:56.270
Exchanging all these rare cards for fake tickets!

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:59.020
There are a lot of idiots in this world easy to fool, or not!

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:00.190
<i>Draw for me!</i>

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:02.690
Looks like business is <i>good</i> over here.

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.820
S-Student Council President?!

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:07.400
Why don't you give me the details?

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:09.400
O-Oh crap!

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:17.370
What's the deal calling me out here like this?

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:20.870
Choose your words carefully when it's just the two of us.

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:23.670
I am an inspector for the Barian Police.

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:25.840
And you are a mere <i>policeman</i>.

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:29.130
Yes! I'll keep that in mind!

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:35.720
Officer Yuma, proceed with
 great caution during the school festival.

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:38.890
We don't know if there's anyone who snuck there way in, after all.

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:41.230
Do you think it's Barian again?

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:42.980
That's a possibility.

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:47.780
We'll conduct a thorough patrol throughout the school there.

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:49.940
Understood, sir!

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:52.360
If I discover a Barian, I'll alert you immed-

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:54.240
Oh, no...

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:59.120
Since I'm the policeman here, I'll fight back with this card!

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:02.580
I'm expecting great work from you, Officer Yuma.

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:06.090
Kotori... Sorry.

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:10.130
I don't want to have to do this either.

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:13.090
But I have to enter the Couple Duel Tournament today

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:16.890
and confirm something no matter what!

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:21.350
"I'm Borrowing this for a while!! ~ Anna"

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:24.810
<i>Fighting each other with all we've got until our Life is depleted!</i>

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:28.270
<i>We're almost there!</i> Let's go!

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:31.440
<i>Heart Duel! Heart Duel!</i>

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:35.240
<i>I've set a Trap of love for you!</i>

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:38.200
<i>Heart Duel! Heart Duel!</i>

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:38.200
Shark-<i>sama</i>!

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:42.200
<i>My fingers burning hot, I draw!</i>

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:46.210
<i>Yes, yes, we Summon Sanagi!</i>

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:57.640
These fried pancakes are delicious!

00:08:58.180 --> 00:08:59.220
Octopus dumplings!

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:01.270
Yummy!

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:02.890
Fried noodles!

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:04.190
Buttered potatoes!

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:05.440
Chocolate banana!

00:09:05.900 --> 00:09:06.850
Cherry candy!

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:09.520
Let's see! What should I eat next?!

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:14.490
Yuma-<i>kun</i>, I'm sure you know this, but we didn't come here to play around.

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:17.700
Eh? Ah? Oh yeah, I know.

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:18.740
Yuma.

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:19.830
What?

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:25.160
What is the difference between the fried pancakes and the fried octopus you ate?

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:27.210
Huh? The difference?

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:29.130
Fried octopus balls have octopus inside them...

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:32.340
So fried pancakes have pan inside them?

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:33.960
Do they?

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:34.720
Yuma!

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:40.760
Anna! What are you doing dressed like that?!

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:45.140
Now I've become a student of this school!

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:49.480
Yuma, I need you to enter the Duel Couple Tournament with me no matter what.

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:50.730
H-Hey!

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:53.780
I won't let you say no, dammit!

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:57.280
I-I got it! I understand!

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:02.830
Dueling against students makes me nervous somehow.

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:06.330
What's going on?

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:11.250
Who's there?!

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:15.800
A proud tag team pair of despair!

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:19.510
Who are you?

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:23.010
You're the most suitable to knock him around.

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:26.810
You will use your strength for my benefit.

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:42.490
Well, it's about time to go out there, my honey.

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:47.080
What's wrong? Not feeling well or something?

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:51.790
No, I'm okay. Nothing's wrong.

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:55.130
Th-That darn Anna!

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:56.670
Just what...

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:01.640
That's it! If she took my student uniform...!

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:04.470
She plans to enter the Couple Duel Tournament!

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:07.060
We won't let her do that!

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:17.690
<i>Those are pros for you! They beat three challenging teams in a row!</i>

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:20.070
<i>And the next challengers will be...</i>

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:21.570
Wait just a minute!

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:24.490
The next challengers are...

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:28.500
Good old me!

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:30.960
A-Anna-<i>chan</i>?

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:34.960
You know her?

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:38.340
That girl was at our wedding.

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:41.050
Yes. She's Anna Kozuki-<i>chan</i>.

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:43.430
I taught her how to Duel.

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.680
<i>Wow, that was impressive!</i>

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:51.390
<i>Yuma Tsukumo, the W.D.C. Champion, 
has snuck in with a girl in toe!</i>

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:53.440
What a surprise, Anna-<i>chan</i>!

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:57.570
I can't believe your boyfriend is the W.D.C. Champion!

00:11:57.780 --> 00:11:59.240
I'm Anna's boyfriend?!

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:00.240
Well...

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:02.030
No, I'm not...

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:03.990
That doesn't matter right now!

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:07.950
Big Sis Umimi, what do you mean you're giving up Dueling?!

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:13.330
You told me you wouldn't stop
 Dueling even if you got married and became an old woman!

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:15.880
You're a liar, Big Sis Umimi!

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:18.050
You're wrong! That's not the case!

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:20.010
I don't wanna hear excuses now!

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:22.880
Big Sis Umimi, you always said this before...

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:27.720
That if I could beat you in a Duel, you'd do anything I asked!

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:33.060
If I win this Duel, you won't stop Dueling!

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:34.730
Anna-<i>chan</i>...

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:39.190
Nothing I say to you now will get through.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:43.150
Fine then. I'll accept this Duel!

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:47.700
There seems to be some disagreement between the two.

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:50.200
Then they just gotta settle it through a Duel!

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:54.210
If two people clash heads in a Duel, any problem can be settled!

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:59.130
Boy! You did well becoming the champion of the Duel Carnival! You're a good kid!

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:00.710
Then here I go!

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:06.800
Duel Disk, set!

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:13.430
Duel Disk, set!

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:15.730
D-Gazer, set!

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:25.030
<i>AR Vision - Link established.</i>

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:29.450
Duel!!

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:36.000
The first turn is mine! My turn! Draw!

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:39.130
Ahhh, I knew it!

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:41.210
Grrr, so frustrating!

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:44.300
<i>All players start at 4000 Life Points.</i>

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:48.090
<i>You win when you beat both opposing players.</i>

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:51.060
<i>We'll first see how the opponents play here...</i>

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:54.810
I activate the Field Magic, Iceberg Ocean!

00:13:57.730 --> 00:14:01.980
This card reduces the Defense Power of all Defense Position Monsters to zero!

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:06.280
Honey, this is my present to you.

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:12.870
Then I activate the Magic Card, Balloon Party!

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:18.210
This card Summons two Balloon Tokens to my field!

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:28.050
I release my two Monsters to Advance Summon the Level Ten Super-colossal Airship Giant Hindenburg!

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:32.640
Amazing!

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:34.430
Why are you getting impressed?!

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:44.150
In a Tag Duel, no player can attack until all players have taken a turn.

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:48.030
I set one card and end my turn.

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:52.070
Here goes! My turn! Draw!

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:54.870
I Summon Gogogogo Golem!

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:05.590
Yuma, it's best for us to harden our defense and watch what our opponents do.

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:06.550
Yeah!

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:09.760
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:13.100
My turn!

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:15.140
Draw!

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:18.980
I activate the Magic Card, Raft Party!

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:24.570
This card Special Summons two Raft Tokens!

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:29.860
I release these two Monsters to Advance Summon!

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:35.080
Show yourself, Super-colossal, Unsinkable 
Superliner Elegant Titanic!

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:40.460
Another amazing thing came out!

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:42.170
Don't be happy about it!

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:49.800
I activate the effect of Giant Hindenburg!

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:53.050
When a Level Five or higher Monster is Summoned,

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:57.640
all Level Nine or lower Monsters on the opponent's field are switched to Defense Position.

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:03.020
Then, thanks to the effect of the Field Magic, Iceberg Ocean,

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:07.360
all face-up Defense Position Monsters' 
Attack Points are reduced to zero!

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:08.940
Gogogogo Golem!

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:12.570
Now Elegant Titanic's effect activates!

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:17.660
Once per turn, it can destroy one Defense Position Monster with zero Defense Points,

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:21.870
and inflict half the destroyed Monster's Attack Power from my opponent's Life Points!

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:28.880
Hey! Stop stumbling around, Yuma!
 What are you getting knocked around for?

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:32.760
Shut it! I'm not doing this because I like it!

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:35.430
So this is the combination of a pair of pros!

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:40.100
I activate my Trap Card, Reborn Puzzle!

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:43.890
When one of my Monsters is destroyed by a Card Effect,

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:47.900
the Special Summoned Monster 
is Special Summoned in Attack Position!

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:51.320
Come back to us, Gogogogo Golem!

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:56.030
Not bad.

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:59.580
I set one card face-down and end my turn.

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:03.830
I was tired of waiting! My turn! Draw!

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:08.670
I Summon the Armored Warrior of Night Travel, 
Night Express Knight!

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:13.420
I can make this guy's Attack Power zero in order to Summon it without release!

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:21.600
There's more where that came from!
 I activate the Magic Card, Southern Cross!

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:25.640
This card lets me change the level of a Monster on the field to Level Ten!

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:28.610
Gogogogo Golem levels up!

00:17:32.650 --> 00:17:36.200
Wow! My Gogogogo Golem became a Level Ten!

00:17:36.360 --> 00:17:37.660
This is most likely...

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:44.000
I Overlay the Level Ten Night Express Knight and Gogogogo Golem!

00:17:49.290 --> 00:17:52.380
I use these two Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:54.090
Xyz Summon!

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:58.840
The Earth itself quakes with its arrival across the railroad!

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:02.640
Come out, Superdreadnought Rail Cannon!

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:10.980
Gustav Max!

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:15.860
Hey! Why're you using my Monster without my permission?!

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:21.620
The rules of this tournament say it's okay to use your opponent's Monsters to Xyz Summon.

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:22.950
Even so...!

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:25.750
Well, you can just keep quiet and watch!

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:30.460
I activate Gustav Max's effect!

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:33.670
By detaching one Overlay Unit from this guy,

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:36.300
I can inflict 2000 points of damage on the opponent!

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:46.850
I'm aiming for Big Sis Umimi!

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:54.820
Now fire! Big Cannon!

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:02.990
I activate the Quick-Play Magic, Engagement Destiny!

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:06.830
This cards lets me halve damage inflicted on my partner,

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:09.330
and I take the remaining damage myself!

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:11.120
What?!

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:17.300
Umimi!

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:25.890
<i>The two of us will halve our suffering and double our happiness!</i>

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:30.730
Yes! No matter what kind of damage we take, it won't hurt if we split it between us!

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:34.060
Meow~! That's lovely!

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:35.860
That's what I yearn for!

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:37.150
Honey.

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:38.530
Darling.

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:44.780
I...I set one card face-down and end my turn.

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:48.620
Now here I go! It's my turn! Draw!

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:52.620
My honey, it's time to show the depth of our love!

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:55.000
Yes, Darling.

00:19:55.880 --> 00:20:01.470
I Overlay the Level 10 Giant Hindenburg and Elegant Titanic!

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:06.510
I use these two Monsters to build the Overlay Network.

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:11.230
At the time when the Hero of the Sky becomes one with the Princess of Oceans,

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:13.770
the great mysteries of the world begin to blossom!

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:38.750
Xyz Summon!

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:43.930
Come forth, Super-colossal Sky Palace Gangaridia!

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:10.620
I activate the effect of Super-colossal Sky Palace Gangaridia!

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:15.080
By detaching one Overlay Unit from Gangaridia,

00:21:15.460 --> 00:21:19.840
I can destroy one opposing Monster on the field and halve that player's Life!

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:22.380
The target is Gustav Max!

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:29.100
Go! Titanic Dive!!

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:40.900
<i>My Gustav Max was...!</i>

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:42.360
Anna!

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:49.450
What an extremely powerful Monster...!

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:56.710
Boy, it's your turn next.

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:03.210
Gangaridia! Direct Attack Yuma Tsukumo!

00:22:17.640 --> 00:22:24.530
<i>Does the thought "In any case..." following</i>

00:22:24.940 --> 00:22:32.200
<i>the foreboding premonition tell you to give up?</i>

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:39.790
<i>Do you laugh at your dreams, saying "impossible"?</i>

00:22:39.790 --> 00:22:47.130
<i>You must find it funny that I'm not able to laugh at it, right?</i>

00:22:47.670 --> 00:23:04.070
<i>This song supports me, so I'll do my best for you this time.
 It's my turn to sing now.</i>

00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:08.860
<i>I will vow to you here</i>

00:23:08.860 --> 00:23:19.210
<i>As long as I live, you'll always be my tiny, little friend</i>

00:23:19.210 --> 00:23:27.760
<i>I'll erase all those little mistakes of yours</i>

00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:32.550
<i>Because I want to become an artist</i>

00:23:34.350 --> 00:23:38.850
<i>Look, I like doing it 'cuz it's fun.</i>

00:23:41.190 --> 00:23:44.610
The Pro Duelists' giant Monster goes to attack Yuma.

00:23:45.190 --> 00:23:49.190
Plus, the combination between Tag Partners Yuma and Anna couldn't be worse!

00:23:50.110 --> 00:23:50.950
If this keeps up...!

00:23:51.360 --> 00:23:53.870
Shoot him down, Gauntlet Shooter!

00:23:54.070 --> 00:23:55.490
He's still got a way.

00:23:55.700 --> 00:23:57.540
Is that woman being controlled by Barian?!

00:23:57.790 --> 00:24:00.660
Chaos Xyz: Super-colossal Flying Fortress?!

00:24:01.370 --> 00:24:03.210
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:24:03.580 --> 00:24:06.170
"Devoted Love: Yuma, I've Entrusted You With My Last Draw!!"

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:08.710
Anna, you aren't...?!
